  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRinggold County, Iowa - County Government and Services\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n Skip to content\n\n\n\n Welcome to the new Ringgold County website!\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n Search\n \n \n \n\n \n\n About\n \n\n Boards & Commissions\n Cemeteries\n Communities\n Elected Officials\n School Districts\n Township Information\n \n \n \n\n Departments\n \n\n Assessor\n Attorney\n Auditor\n Board of Supervisors\n Clerk of Court\n Conservation\n E911\n Emergency Management\n General Assistance \n Public Health\n RCSS\n Recorder\n Secondary Roads\n Sheriff\n Treasurer\n Veterans Affairs\n \n \n \n\n Resources\n \n \n\n Bid Notices\n Calendar\n Frequently Asked Questions\n Job Opportunities\n News\n Notifications\n WRD Landfill\n \n \n \n\n Contact\n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \nWebsite Search\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n Create Tomorrow's Memories\n \nWelcome to Ringgold County\n \n \n\n View Departments + Services \n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n Agendas + Minutes \n \n \n\n \n \n Elections \n \n \n\n \n \n FAQ \n \n \n\n \n \n Notifications \n \n \n\n \n \n Pay Property Taxes \n \n \n\n \n \n Property Search \n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n News\n \nThings to Know\n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n\n 2 Job Openings\n \n October 12 \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n Welcome to the New Ringgold County Website\n \n September 28 \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n 2026 General Election Information\n \n September 25 \n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n View All News \n\n\n\n\n \n\n County Calendar\n \nMeetings + Events\n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n Sep 1st - Dec 31st \n Renewals for ATV, ORV, ORM & Snowmobiles\n \n\n \nRenewals for ATV, ORV, ORM & Snowmobiles\n \n \n September 1, 2026 to December 31, 2026 \nPosted by: Recorder \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n October 19th \n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 9:00 am\n Courthouse Board Office \n Agenda \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n Courthouse Board Office\n 109 W. Madison\n Mount Ayr, IA\n Map to Event\n\n \n\n October 19, 2026 \n 9:00 am \n\nThe Ringgold County Board of Supervisors meets regularly on Mondays beginning at 9:00 a.m. in the Board of Supervisors Office in the Ringgold County Courthouse. If not on the agenda, public comment is limited to 5 minutes per person. To be included on an upcoming agenda, requests must be submitted to the Auditor's Office by 4:00 p.m. on the Thursday preceding the Monday meeting. \n Agenda \nPosted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n October 26th \n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 9:00 am\n Courthouse Board Office \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n Courthouse Board Office\n 109 W. Madison\n Mount Ayr, IA\n Map to Event\n\n \n\n October 26, 2026 \n 9:00 am \n\nThe Ringgold County Board of Supervisors meets regularly on Mondays beginning at 9:00 a.m. in the Board of Supervisors Office in the Ringgold County Courthouse. If not on the agenda, public comment is limited to 5 minutes per person. To be included on an upcoming agenda, requests must be submitted to the Auditor's Office by 4:00 p.m. on the Thursday preceding the Monday meeting. \nPosted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n November 2nd \n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 9:00 am\n Courthouse Board Office \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n Courthouse Board Office\n 109 W. Madison\n Mount Ayr, IA\n Map to Event\n\n \n\n November 2, 2026 \n 9:00 am \n\nThe Ringgold County Board of Supervisors meets regularly on Mondays beginning at 9:00 a.m. in the Board of Supervisors Office in the Ringgold County Courthouse. If not on the agenda, public comment is limited to 5 minutes per person. To be included on an upcoming agenda, requests must be submitted to the Auditor's Office by 4:00 p.m. on the Thursday preceding the Monday meeting. \nPosted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n \n\n View Full Calendar \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \nAbout \n \n\nRinggold County \n \n\nRinggold County is helping redefine Small Town, USA. It is a place where history, values and innovation unite to provide a great place for businesses to thrive, families to grow, and transformation to take oﬀ. \n \n\nRead More About Our History \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n \nStay connected. Sign up today.\n \n \n\n \nBe the first to know about alerts, county news, employment opportunities, and board agendas by signing up for email alerts about the topics that matter most to you. \n \nSign up for Notifications \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n Courthouse\n\n 109 W. Madison St.\n \nMount Ayr, IA 50854\n\n Contact Us \n \n \n\n Hours\n\n M-F 8:00 am to 4:00 pm\n \nDepartment Hours May Vary Closed Holidays \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n©2026 Ringgold County, Iowa | Accessibility\n \npowered by \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \nUpcoming Holiday Closure Schedule\n \n \nVeterans Day (November 11, 2026)\n \nThanksgiving (November 26, 2026)\n \nThanksgiving (November 27, 2026)\n \nChristmas Eve (December 24, 2026)\n \nChristmas Day (December 25, 2026)\n \nNew Year's (January 1, 2027)\n \n\n"
